References skipped due to @SuppressKafkaInternalApiUsage on the consumer.
Each line shows the reason supplied to the annotation; review periodically.
- Suppressed reference to internal Kafka class org.apache.kafka.clients.producer.ProducerRecord
  from com.mycompany.app.App#main (line 48) — …
